      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "1. Load",
      "text": "%md\n## 1. Load the rows of the view\n\nEach row of the view is **one item on one declaration**: a declaration with 5 kinds of goods has 5 rows.\nWe take the columns below for the 3 years before the snapshot (all regimes, so the cleaning in Part 3 can\nshow what it removes), and give each column its type.\n\n| Type | Columns |\n|---|---|\n| Text (codes and IDs) | `instance_id` (declaration ID), `entry_num`, `dec_ref_yer` (year), `clearance_station_cd`, `taxpayer_tin`, `taxpayer_nm`, `consignee_tin`, `consignee_nm`, `hsc_cd` (tariff code), `gds_org_cty` (origin), `cpc_cd` (APC), `extended_proc_cd` (EPC), `regime_cd`, `decl_status`, `pay_status`, `key_itm_nbr` (item number) |\n| Yes or no (`Y` or `N`) | `top_up_flg`, `amendment_flg`, `preferential_treatment_flag` |\n| Lane (1 = selected) | `is_red_flg`, `is_yellow_flg` |\n| Numbers (UGX, kg, units) | `customs_value`, `net_weight`, `supplementary_qnty`, `tax_assessed`, `original_tax_amt`, `final_amt`, `top_up_amt` |\n| Date | `assessment_dt_wid` (text `yyyymmdd`), turned into a real date `adate` |\n\nTwo columns are added: `adate` (the date) and `entry_key`, the entry number + station + year\n(for example `C12345UGKLA2026`), which identifies an entry. Where any part is blank, the declaration ID is used.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_003",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_003",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "1.1 Load",
      "text": "%pyspark\nTEXT = ['instance_id', 'entry_num', 'dec_ref_yer', 'clearance_station_cd', 'taxpayer_tin', 'taxpayer_nm',\n        'consignee_tin', 'consignee_nm', 'hsc_cd', 'gds_org_cty', 'cpc_cd', 'extended_proc_cd', 'regime_cd',\n        'decl_status', 'pay_status', 'key_itm_nbr', 'top_up_flg', 'amendment_flg', 'preferential_treatment_flag',\n        'assessment_dt_wid']\nNUMBERS = ['customs_value', 'net_weight', 'supplementary_qnty', 'tax_assessed', 'original_tax_amt', 'final_amt',\n           'top_up_amt']\nLANES = ['is_red_flg', 'is_yellow_flg']\n\nv = spark.table(VIEW)\nrows = (v.select([F.col(c).cast('string').alias(c) for c in TEXT]\n                 + [F.col(c).cast('double').alias(c) for c in NUMBERS]\n                 + [F.col(c).cast('int').alias(c) for c in LANES])\n         .where((F.col('assessment_dt_wid') > HIST3_START) & (F.col('assessment_dt_wid') <= OUT_END))\n         .withColumn('adate', F.to_date('assessment_dt_wid', 'yyyyMMdd'))\n         .withColumn('entry_key', F.coalesce(F.concat('entry_num', 'clearance_station_cd', 'dec_ref_yer'),\n                                             F.col('instance_id'))))\nif SAMPLE_1_IN:\n    rows = rows.where(F.pmod(F.hash('taxpayer_tin'), SAMPLE_1_IN) == 0)\nrows = rows.cache()\n\nn_loaded = rows.count()\nprint('Item rows loaded: {:,}'.format(n_loaded))\npeek(rows)",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "python",
