    },
    {
      "title": "2. Explore",
      "text": "%md\n## 2. Explore the rows (EDA)\n\nBefore building anything we look at what the data holds: how much there is, what is **missing**, what is\n**duplicated**, then values, goods, lanes and top-ups.\nThen we list every **data problem** we found. Each problem leads to a cleaning rule in Part 3 or a choice in the\nfeatures. The Risk Officers are asked to confirm each one (Part 2.7 gives them the rows behind each problem).\n\nThe exploration uses the same window as the features: IM4 and IM7 declarations in the 24 months before the\nsnapshot.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_006",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_006",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "2.1 Size",
      "text": "%pyspark\neda = rows.where((F.col('assessment_dt_wid') > HIST_START) & (F.col('assessment_dt_wid') <= SNAP)\n                 & F.col('regime_cd').isin('IM4', 'IM7'))\n\n# How much data, per year (rows repeat items, so declarations and entries are counted as distinct IDs)\nsize = (eda.groupBy(F.substring('assessment_dt_wid', 1, 4).alias('year'))\n           .agg(F.count('*').alias('item_rows'),\n                F.countDistinct('instance_id').alias('declarations'),\n                F.countDistinct('entry_key').alias('entries'),\n                F.countDistinct('taxpayer_tin').alias('taxpayers'))\n           .orderBy('year'))\nz.show(size)",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "python",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionSupport": true
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/python",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": true,
        "editorHide": false,
