      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_028",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_028",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Declarations",
      "text": "%md\n## 4. From item rows to declarations\n\nMany features count **declarations** (for example \"share of declarations amended\"). Tax, top-up, lane and status\nare the same on every item of a declaration, so the items are grouped into one row per declaration:\n\n* **Value** = the sum of the items' customs values. **Items** = how many items.\n* **Original tax**: blank means unchanged, so it is filled with the final tax (E08).\n* **Topped up** = the top-up flag is `Y` **and** the final tax is above the original tax (E06).\n  **Top-up amount** = final tax minus original tax (E09: `top_up_amt` is not used).\n* **Tax reduced** = the final tax is below the original tax.\n* **Severe top-up** = a top-up of 30% or more of the final tax.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_029",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_029",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "4.1 Declarations",
      "text": "%pyspark\ndecl = (items.groupBy('instance_id')\n             .agg(F.max('taxpayer_tin').alias('taxpayer_tin'),\n                  F.max('taxpayer_nm').alias('taxpayer_nm'),\n                  F.max('adate').alias('adate'),\n                  F.max('assessment_dt_wid').alias('dt'),\n                  F.max('regime_cd').alias('regime'),\n                  F.coalesce(F.max('original_tax_amt'), F.max('final_amt')).alias('orig_tax'),   # blank = unchanged\n                  F.max('final_amt').alias('final_tax'),\n                  F.max('top_up_flg').alias('top_up_flg'),\n                  F.max('amendment_flg').alias('amended'),\n                  F.max('clearance_station_cd').alias('station'),\n                  F.max('is_red_flg').alias('red'),\n                  F.max('is_yellow_flg').alias('yellow'),\n                  F.max('pay_status').alias('pay_status'),\n                  F.sum('customs_value').alias('value'),\n                  F.count('*').alias('n_items')))\n\ntopped_up = (F.col('top_up_flg') == 'Y') & (F.col('final_tax') > F.col('orig_tax'))\ndecl = (decl.withColumn('topped_up', F.when(topped_up, 1).otherwise(0))\n            .withColumn('top_up', F.when(topped_up, F.col('final_tax') - F.col('orig_tax')).otherwise(0.0))\n            .withColumn('negative_top_up', F.when(F.col('final_tax') < F.col('orig_tax'), 1).otherwise(0))\n            .withColumn('severe', F.when((F.col('topped_up') == 1)\n                                         & (F.col('top_up') >= 0.30 * F.col('final_tax')), 1).otherwise(0))\n            .cache())\n\n# The 24-month history window used by the features (never anything after the snapshot)\nin_history = (F.col('dt') > HIST_START) & (F.col('dt') <= SNAP)\nhist = decl.where(in_history).cache()\nhist_items = items.where((F.col('assessment_dt_wid') > HIST_START) & (F.col('assessment_dt_wid') <= SNAP)).cache()\nprint('Declarations in the 24 months: {:,}'.format(hist.count()))\npeek(hist.select('instance_id', 'taxpayer_tin', 'dt', 'regime', 'n_items', 'value', 'orig_tax', 'final_tax',\n                 'top_up_flg', 'topped_up', 'top_up', 'severe', 'negative_top_up', 'amended', 'red', 'yellow',\n                 'station'))",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "python",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionSupport": true
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/python",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": true,
        "editorHide": false,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_030",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_030",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "4.2 One row per taxpayer",
      "text": "%md\n### 4.2 One row per taxpayer: the starting table\n\nEvery taxpayer with at least one clean declaration in the 24 months gets a row. Each feature below is built as a\nsmall table (one row per taxpayer) and kept in `parts`; Part 8 puts them side by side.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_031",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_031",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "4.2 Starting table",
      "text": "%pyspark\nbase = (hist.groupBy('taxpayer_tin')\n            .agg(F.max(F.struct('dt', 'taxpayer_nm')).getField('taxpayer_nm').alias('taxpayer_nm'),  # latest name\n                 F.count('*').alias('decl_24m_count'),                     # declarations in 24 months\n                 F.sum('value').alias('customs_value_24m_ugx'),\n                 F.sum('orig_tax').alias('original_tax_24m_ugx'),\n                 F.sum('top_up').alias('top_up_24m_ugx'))\n            .cache())\nparts = {}\nprint('Taxpayers: {:,}'.format(base.count()))\npeek(base)",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "python",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionSupport": true
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/python",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": true,
        "editorHide": false,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_032",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_032",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Track A",
      "text": "%md\n## 5. Track A: the compliance history (8 features)\n\nThese are the scored parameters agreed with the Risk Officers. Each is a **rate**, so a large and a small importer\ncan be compared fairly. Here they are first built over 24 months; Part 7 then gives recent years more weight (the\n`3y` versions) and protects small traders, as production does.\n\n| Feature the scorecard reads | Parameter | Points (likelihood x impact) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `topped_up_per_decl_3y_rate` | PAR_045T Declarations topped up | L5 x I5, scale 0.03 to 0.4 |\n| `severe_top_up_per_decl_3y_rate` | PAR_077 Severe top-ups | L4 x I5, scale 0.02 to 0.2 |\n| `amended_per_decl_3y_rate` | PAR_045 Declarations amended | L4 x I4, scale 0.1 to 0.5 |\n| `top_up_per_final_tax_3y_rate` | PAR_048 Top-ups as a share of final tax | L3 x I1, scale 0.05 to 0.25 |\n| `peer_price_shortfall_per_value_24m_rate` | PAR_076 Value below benchmark | L3 x I1, scale 0.02 to 0.2 |\n| `tax_reduced_per_decl_3y_rate` | PAR_066 Tax reduced after assessment | L3 x I1, scale 0.02 to 0.2 |\n| `top_up_last_180d_flag` | PAR_105 Recent top-ups | L3 x I1, scale 0 to 1 |\n| `away_from_main_station_per_decl_24m_rate` | PAR_023 Clearance away from main station | L3 x I1, scale 0.3 to 0.7 |",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_033",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_033",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "5.1",
      "text": "%md\n### 5.1 `topped_up_per_decl_24m_rate`: declarations topped up (PAR_045T, the officers' rule)\n\n**Inputs:** `topped_up` (0 or 1 per declaration, Part 4). **Logic:** topped-up declarations \u00f7 declarations.\n**Why:** a taxpayer often found under-declaring is likely to be found again.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
