      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "5.2",
      "text": "%md\n### 5.2 `severe_top_up_per_decl_24m_rate`: severe top-ups (PAR_077)\n\n**Inputs:** `severe` (0 or 1: a top-up of 30% or more of the final tax). **Logic:** severe top-ups \u00f7 declarations.\n**Why:** a large correction says more about intent than a small one.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
