    {
      "title": "5.6",
      "text": "%md\n### 5.6 `top_up_last_180d_flag`: a top-up in the last 180 days (PAR_105)\n\n**Inputs:** `adate` of topped-up declarations. **Logic:** days from the last top-up to the snapshot. The feature is\n1 if that is 180 days or fewer, else 0 (also 0 when there was no top-up). **Why:** recent non-compliance matters\nmore than old.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
