    {
      "title": "5.7",
      "text": "%md\n### 5.7 `away_from_main_station_per_decl_24m_rate`: clearing away from the main station (PAR_023, also in Track B)\n\n**Inputs:** `clearance_station_cd` per declaration. **Logic:** count declarations per station. The main station is\nthe busiest. The feature is 1 \u2212 the main station's share. **Why:** moving between stations can be a search for\neasier checks.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
