      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Track B",
      "text": "%md\n## 6. Track B: how the taxpayer trades (17 features)\n\nTrack B looks for risk the current checks have not yet caught, so it uses **no** input that records what customs\ndid (no top-ups, no lanes). Three of its features were built above: `amended_per_decl_24m_rate` (5.3),\n`peer_price_shortfall_per_value_24m_rate` (5.8) and `away_from_main_station_per_decl_24m_rate` (5.7).",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_051",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_051",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "6.1",
      "text": "%md\n### 6.1 `unpaid_tax_per_decl_24m_rate`: tax left unpaid (stand-in for PAR_072)\n\n**Inputs:** `pay_status`, `final_amt`. **Logic:** declarations with tax due and status `NOT_PAID` \u00f7 declarations.\n**Why:** unpaid tax is non-compliance in itself.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
