      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_053",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_053",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "6.2",
      "text": "%md\n### 6.2 `pref_claimed_per_item_24m_rate`: preferential treatment claimed (PAR_050)\n\n**Inputs:** `preferential_treatment_flag` (item rows). **Logic:** items claiming preference \u00f7 items.\n**Why:** a false origin claim (EAC, COMESA) avoids duty.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
