    },
    {
      "title": "6.10",
      "text": "%md\n### 6.10 `new_importer_24m_score`: recently started importing (PAR_019, PAR_101)\n\n**Inputs:** `adate`, and the taxpayers who declared IM4 or IM7 in the 3 years **before** the 24-month window.\n**Logic:** `new_trader` = not among them. `new_importer_24m_score` = \u2212log(1 + days since the first declaration in the window), plus 1\nfor a new trader, so newer gives a higher value. **Why:** new traders have no track record, and new TINs are used for\none-off fraud.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_070",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_070",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "6.10 new_importer_24m_score",
      "text": "%pyspark\nday = F.col('assessment_dt_wid').cast('string')\nearlier_importers = (spark.table(VIEW)\n    .where((day > PRIOR_START) & (day <= HIST_START)\n           & F.col('regime_cd').isin('IM4', 'IM7') & (F.col('decl_status') != 'Cancelled')\n           & F.col('taxpayer_tin').cast('string').rlike('^[0-9]{10}$'))\n    .select(F.col('taxpayer_tin').cast('string').alias('taxpayer_tin')).distinct()\n    .withColumn('imported_before', F.lit(1)))\n\ndays_since_first = F.datediff(snap_date, F.min('adate'))\nfirst_seen = hist.groupBy('taxpayer_tin').agg(days_since_first.alias('days_since_first_decl_24m'))\nparts['new_importer_24m_score'] = (first_seen.join(earlier_importers, 'taxpayer_tin', 'left')\n    .withColumn('new_trader', F.when(F.col('imported_before').isNull(), 'Y').otherwise('N'))\n    .withColumn('new_importer_24m_score', -F.log1p(F.greatest('days_since_first_decl_24m', F.lit(0)))\n                           + F.when(F.col('new_trader') == 'Y', 1.0).otherwise(0.0))\n    .drop('imported_before'))\npeek(parts['new_importer_24m_score'])",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "python",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionSupport": true
        },
