      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_076",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_076",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "8. Final dataset",
      "text": "%md\n## 8. The final dataset\n\nOne row per taxpayer. This is what the scorecard (Track A) and the model (Track B) read.\n\n| Columns | What they are |\n|---|---|\n| `taxpayer_tin`, `taxpayer_nm`, `snapshot_date` | who, and the date of the profile |\n| `decl_24m_count`, `customs_value_24m_ugx` | declarations and customs value (UGX) in the 24 months |\n| `limited_history` | `Y` = fewer than 10 declarations: the score rests on little history |\n| `no_top_up_history` | `Y` = no top-up in the 24 months: the group Track B is built for |\n| 8 Track A columns (for example `topped_up_per_decl_3y_rate`) | the values the scorecard reads |\n| the same starting `raw_` | before the small-numbers step (shown in the reasons) |\n| 17 columns starting `b_` | the Track B features |\n| the same ending `pct` (for example `b_amended_per_decl_24m_pct`) | the percentile within the peer group: what the model reads |\n| `peer_group` | main goods (HS section) and size |\n| `out_...` (past snapshots only) | what happened in the 6 months after: checks, checks that found a top-up, top-up amounts |",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_077",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_eda_077",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "8.1 Final dataset",
      "text": "%pyspark\nfinal['limited_history'] = np.where(final['decl_24m_count'] < 10, 'Y', 'N')\nfinal['no_top_up_history'] = np.where(final['top_up_24m_ugx'].fillna(0) <= 0, 'Y', 'N')\n\nif WITH_OUTCOMES:\n    after = decl.where(F.col('dt') > SNAP)\n    checked = (F.col('red') == 1) | (F.col('yellow') == 1)\n    outcomes = after.groupBy('taxpayer_tin').agg(\n        F.count('*').alias('out_entries'),\n        F.sum(F.when(checked, 1).otherwise(0)).alias('out_checked'),\n        F.sum(F.when(checked & (F.col('topped_up') == 1), 1).otherwise(0)).alias('out_checked_hits'),\n        F.sum('topped_up').alias('out_topped_up_entries'),\n        F.sum('top_up').alias('out_top_up'),\n        F.sum('orig_tax').alias('out_original_tax')).toPandas()\n    final = final.merge(outcomes, on='taxpayer_tin', how='left')\n    out_cols = [c for c in final if c.startswith('out_')]\n    final[out_cols] = final[out_cols].fillna(0)\n\nfirst = ['taxpayer_tin', 'taxpayer_nm', 'snapshot_date', 'decl_24m_count', 'customs_value_24m_ugx', 'limited_history',\n         'no_top_up_history', 'peer_group']\ntrack_a = list(TRACK_A) + ['raw_' + c for c in TRACK_A]\ntrack_b = ['b_' + c for c in TRACK_B] + [percentile_name(c) for c in TRACK_B]\nfinal_dataset = final[first + track_a + track_b + [c for c in final if c.startswith('out_')]]\nsave(final_dataset, 'ctrp_final_dataset')\nprint('{:,} taxpayers x {} columns, saved as ctrp_final_dataset'.format(*final_dataset.shape))\npeek(final_dataset)",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
